    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηγκενίδες</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, αἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>long planks</i>
			bolted to the upright ribs(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταμίνες</span>) of
			the ship, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.253
			</span></i>. (Prob. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκών</span>:
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηγανίδες</span> (sic). <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηνύηματα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπητανίδεσσι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτανίδες</span> cod.) was read by <i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> l.c.)</div>
